rakun is a fork of Relic, which is a fork of Heroic Games Launcher (GPL-3.0).
The full git history of both projects is kept in this repository.

People who contributed to that history, most commits first (names only; emails
are in the git log). Regenerate the raw data with: git shortlog -sne HEAD

